---
title: From approved work to quality check
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Service advisor
  participant W as Job card · Work card
  participant DB as Postgres (functions + triggers)
  actor M as Mechanic (phone)
  participant P as My jobs

  A->>W: Create tasks from approved work, assign mechanic
  W->>DB: create_tasks_from_estimate(job, mechanic)
  DB-->>M: Notification "JC-0002: new task"
  M->>P: Open My jobs → job (no prices, no customer details)
  P->>DB: get_assigned_job(job)
  M->>P: Start
  P->>DB: update_task_status(task, in_progress)
  DB->>DB: Job Approved → In progress ("Work started")
  M->>P: Blocked… "Waiting for parts"
  P->>DB: update_task_status(task, blocked, reason)
  Note over DB: blank reason → refused (reason_required)
  DB-->>A: Notification "task blocked — Waiting for parts"
  A->>W: Sees the banner · may Put on hold
  M->>P: Resume → Mark done · records parts used · photos · notes
  DB-->>A: Notification "all tasks complete — ready for quality check"
  A->>W: Work complete — quality check
  W->>DB: change_job_status(finish_work)
  Note over DB: refused while any task is still open (tasks_open)
